class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Featured</button></span><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Getting Started</button></span><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>App Development</button></span><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>DevOps</button></span></div></div></a></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white-00 dark:bg-gray-85 hover:dark:bg-blue-95"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/text_embedding_as_snowpark_python_udf/index.html"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-solid border-slate-200 p-6 h-full flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition duration-300 ease-out"><div><p class="font-mono text-placeholder mb-2 text-sm">12 Minutes</p><p class="font-semibold">Text Embedding As A Snowpark Python UDF<!-- --><span class="opacity-60 ml-1.5"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-up-right-from-square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-up-right-from-square " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64C256 46.33 270.3 32 288 32H415.1C415.1 32 415.1 32 415.1 32C420.3 32 424.5 32.86 428.2 34.43C431.1 35.98 435.5 38.27 438.6 41.3C438.6 41.35 438.6 41.4 438.7 41.44C444.9 47.66 447.1 55.78 448 63.9C448 63.94 448 63.97 448 64V192C448 209.7 433.7 224 416 224C398.3 224 384 209.7 384 192V141.3L214.6 310.6C202.1 323.1 181.9 323.1 169.4 310.6C156.9 298.1 156.9 277.9 169.4 265.4L338.7 96H288C270.3 96 256 81.67 256 64V64zM0 128C0 92.65 28.65 64 64 64H160C177.7 64 192 78.33 192 96C192 113.7 177.7 128 160 128H64V416H352V320C352 302.3 366.3 288 384 288C401.7 288 416 302.3 416 320V416C416 451.3 387.3 480 352 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V128z"></path></svg></span></p><p class="line-clamp-4 text-sm mt-1.5">Text Embedding As A Snowpark Python UDF</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Data Science &amp; ML</button></span></div></div></a></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white-00 dark:bg-gray-85 hover:dark:bg-blue-95"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/Vulnerability Intelligence on Snowflake/index.html"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-solid border-slate-200 p-6 h-full flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition duration-300 ease-out"><div><p class="font-mono text-placeholder mb-2 text-sm">48 Minutes</p><p class="font-semibold">Threat Intelligence on Snowflake Setup Guide<!-- --><span class="opacity-60 ml-1.5"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-up-right-from-square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-up-right-from-square " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64C256 46.33 270.3 32 288 32H415.1C415.1 32 415.1 32 415.1 32C420.3 32 424.5 32.86 428.2 34.43C431.1 35.98 435.5 38.27 438.6 41.3C438.6 41.35 438.6 41.4 438.7 41.44C444.9 47.66 447.1 55.78 448 63.9C448 63.94 448 63.97 448 64V192C448 209.7 433.7 224 416 224C398.3 224 384 209.7 384 192V141.3L214.6 310.6C202.1 323.1 181.9 323.1 169.4 310.6C156.9 298.1 156.9 277.9 169.4 265.4L338.7 96H288C270.3 96 256 81.67 256 64V64zM0 128C0 92.65 28.65 64 64 64H160C177.7 64 192 78.33 192 96C192 113.7 177.7 128 160 128H64V416H352V320C352 302.3 366.3 288 384 288C401.7 288 416 302.3 416 320V416C416 451.3 387.3 480 352 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V128z"></path></svg></span></p><p class="line-clamp-4 text-sm mt-1.5">This guide will walk you through how to load sample security data info Snowflake tables and then join the data meaningfully and present that information using a Streamlit frontend.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Cybersecurity</button></span></div></div></a></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white-00 dark:bg-gray-85 hover:dark:bg-blue-95"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/python_camouflage/index.html"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-solid border-slate-200 p-6 h-full flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition duration-300 ease-out"><div><p class="font-mono text-placeholder mb-2 text-sm">43 Minutes</p><p class="font-semibold">Tokenization in Snowflake Using Python UDFs (Python Camouflage)<!-- --><span class="opacity-60 ml-1.5"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-up-right-from-square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-up-right-from-square " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64C256 46.33 270.3 32 288 32H415.1C415.1 32 415.1 32 415.1 32C420.3 32 424.5 32.86 428.2 34.43C431.1 35.98 435.5 38.27 438.6 41.3C438.6 41.35 438.6 41.4 438.7 41.44C444.9 47.66 447.1 55.78 448 63.9C448 63.94 448 63.97 448 64V192C448 209.7 433.7 224 416 224C398.3 224 384 209.7 384 192V141.3L214.6 310.6C202.1 323.1 181.9 323.1 169.4 310.6C156.9 298.1 156.9 277.9 169.4 265.4L338.7 96H288C270.3 96 256 81.67 256 64V64zM0 128C0 92.65 28.65 64 64 64H160C177.7 64 192 78.33 192 96C192 113.7 177.7 128 160 128H64V416H352V320C352 302.3 366.3 288 384 288C401.7 288 416 302.3 416 320V416C416 451.3 387.3 480 352 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V128z"></path></svg></span></p><p class="line-clamp-4 text-sm mt-1.5">Project Python Camouflage aims to give a working MVP for tokenization in Snowflake using Python. The problem this aims to solve is allowing customers to obfuscate (or “mask”) PII while at the same time not losing the ability to use that data in joins and other operations where the consistency of the data through operations is required. Python offers libraries to achieve this using encryption, and through the use of Snowflake Python UDFs we can apply that to information in Snowflake natively. As an MVP, this is not meant to offer a complete solution to the problem. Rather, this is a framework that others can embrace and extend.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Cybersecurity</button></span><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Architecture Patterns</button></span><span class="bg-level-3 rounded-lg px-1.5 py-1 text-secondary text-xs"><button>Solution Examples</button></span></div></div></a></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white-00 dark:bg-gray-85 hover:dark:bg-blue-95"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/train-an-xgboost-model-with-gpus-using-snowflake-notebooks/index.html"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-solid border-slate-200 p-6 h-full flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition duration-300 ease-out"><div><p class="font-mono text-placeholder mb-2 text-sm">34 Minutes</p><p class="font-semibold">Train an XGBoost Model with GPUs using Snowflake Notebooks<!-- --><span class="opacity-60 ml-1.5"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="arrow-up-right-from-square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-arrow-up-right-from-square " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 64C256 46.33 270.3 32 288 32H415.1C415.1 32 415.1 32 415.1 32C420.3 32 424.5 32.86 428.2 34.43C431.1 35.98 435.5 38.27 438.6 41.3C438.6 41.35 438.6 41.4 438.7 41.44C444.9 47.66 447.1 55.78 448 63.9C448 63.94 448 63.97 448 64V192C448 209.7 433.7 224 416 224C398.3 224 384 209.7 384 192V141.3L214.6 310.6C202.1 323.1 181.9 323.1 169.4 310.6C156.9 298.1 156.9 277.9 169.4 265.4L338.7 96H288C270.3 96 256 81.67 256 64V64zM0 128C0 92.65 28.65 64 64 64H160C177.7 64 192 78.33 192 96C192 113.7 177.7 128 160 128H64V416H352V320C352 302.3 366.3 288 384 288C401.7 288 416 302.3 416 320V416