n":30,"title":"Load data from cloud storage: GCS","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/load-from-cloud-tutorial-gcs","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to use SQL commands to load data from cloud storage.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Load data from cloud storage: Microsoft Azure","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/load-from-cloud-tutorial-azure","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to use SQL commands to load data from cloud storage.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Snowflake in 20 minutes","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/snowflake-in-20minutes","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to interact with Snowflake using SnowSQL.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":15,"title":"Build a simple search application with Cortex Search","categories":["Cortex Search","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/snowflake-cortex/cortex-search/tutorials/cortex-search-tutorial-1-search","summary":"This tutorial walks through a basic end-to-end setup for using Cortex Search on a dataset consisting of AirBnb listings.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Create a database, schema, table, and warehouse","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started","App Development","Data Engineering"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowflake-python-api/tutorials/tutorial-1","summary":"Create and manage a Snowflake database, schema, table, and warehouse using the Snowflake Python APIs.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":60,"title":"Create a Snowpark Container Services Service","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowpark-container-services/tutorials/tutorial-1","summary":"Create an introductory Snowpark Container Service that echoes prompts.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":25,"title":"Create and manage databases, schemas, and tables","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started","App Development","Data Engineering","Rest Api"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowflake-rest-api/tutorials/tutorial-1","summary":"This tutorial provides instructions for managing databases, schemas, and tables.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":15,"title":"Build a simple chat application with Cortex Search","categories":["Cortex Search","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/snowflake-cortex/cortex-search/tutorials/cortex-search-tutorial-2-chat","summary":"This tutorial walks through building a basic chatbot with Cortex Search and LLM functions on a dataset consisting of book descriptions and authors.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":60,"title":"Create a Snowpark Container Services Job Service","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowpark-container-services/tutorials/tutorial-2","summary":"Create a Snowpark Container Service Job.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":25,"title":"Create and manage tasks","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started","App Development","Data Engineering","Rest Api"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowflake-rest-api/tutorials/tutorial-2","summary":"This tutorial provides instructions for creating and managing tasks.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Create and manage tasks and task graphs (DAGs)","categories":["Snowflake","Getting Started","App Development","Data Engineering"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowflake-python-api/tutorials/tutorial-2","summary":"Create and manage Snowflake tasks and task graphs (DAGs) using the Snowflake Python APIs.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duratio