ries":["Cortex Analyst","Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/snowflake-cortex/cortex-analyst/tutorials/tutorial-1","summary":"This tutorial walks through a basic end-to-end setup for using Cortex Analyst on a time-series revenue data set.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Bulk loading from a local file system using COPY","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/data-load-internal-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial describes how to load data from files in your local file system into a table.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Bulk loading from Amazon S3 using COPY","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/data-load-external-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial describes how to load data from files in an existing Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket into a table.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Create a document processing pipeline with Document AI","categories":["Document AI","Data Science \u0026 AI","AI"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/snowflake-cortex/document-ai/tutorials/create-processing-pipelines","summary":"This tutorial describes how to prepare a Document AI model build and create a processing pipeline using streams and tasks.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":60,"title":"Create a Snowflake Native App with Snowpark Container Services","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/native-apps/tutorials/na-spcs-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial describes how to create a Snowflake Native App with Snowpark Container Services using the Snowflake Native App Framework and Snowpark Container Services.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Create your first |iceberg-tm| table","categories":["Snowflake","Iceberg","Data Lake"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/create-your-first-iceberg-table","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to create, update, and query a Snowflake-managed Iceberg table.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Developing a Snowflake Native App with the Snowflake Native App Framework","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/native-apps/tutorials/getting-started-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial describes how to use the Snowflake Native App Framework to create a Snowflake Native App to share data and related business logic with other Snowflake accounts.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":40,"title":"Get started with budgets","categories":["Snowflake","Cost Monitoring","Getting Started","Audit"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/budgets","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to activate and set up the account budget and create a custom budget.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Get started with logging and tracing","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/logging-tracing/tutorials/logging-tracing-getting-started","summary":"This tutorial introduces the basics of emitting, collecting, and querying log and trace data from function and procedure handler code.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Get started with the web app of a Snowflake Data Clean Room","categories":["Data Sharing"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/cleanrooms/tutorials/cleanroom-web-app-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial describes how to use a Snowflake Data Clean Room to collaborate within a privacy-preserving environment.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Getting started with data metric functions","categories":["Snowflake","Data Governance","Data Quality"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/data-quality-tutorial-start","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to use a custom data metric function to measure data quality.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Improve Workload Performance with the Query Acceleration Service","categories":["Data Engineering"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/query-acceleration-service","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to leverage the Query Acceleration Service (QAS) to improve your overall workload performance.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"JSON basics for Snowflake","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/json-basics-tutorial","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn the basics of using JSON with Snowflake.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Loading and unloading Parquet data","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/script-data-load-transform-parquet","summary":"Loading and unloading Parquet data","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":20,"title":"Loading JSON data into a relational table","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"core","url":"/user-guide/tutorials/script-data-load-transform-json","summary":"Loading JSON data into a relational table.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":60,"title":"Native SDK for Connectors Java Template","categories":["Snowflake","Connector","Native Sdk"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/native-apps/connector-sdk/tutorials/native_sdk_tutorial","summary":"In this tutorial you will learn how to use the Native SDK for Connectors template to accelerate initial development of a Connector Native Application.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-24 17:07:21 -0400"},{"duration":30,"title":"Testing Python Snowpark","categories":["App Development"],"contentType":"core","url":"/developer-guide/snowpark/python/tutorials/testing-tutorial","summary":"This tutorial 