ide","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-05-22T07:44:42-07:00"},{"duration":23,"title":"Attaining Consumer Insights with Snowflake and Microsoft Power BI","categories":["Partner Integrations"],"contentType":"quickstart","url":"https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/attaining_consumer_insights_with_snowflake_and_microsoft_power_bi/index.html","summary":"In this lab, you’ll learn how to access all relevant data from a single source and turn data into insights through the Microsoft PowerBI integration.","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-03-05T10:16:29-08:00"},{"duration":43,"title":"Auto-Ingest Twitter Data into Snowflake","categories":["Data Engineering","App Development","Solution Examples","Marketing"],"contentType":"quickstart","url":"https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/auto_ingest_twitter_data/index.html","summary":"Auto-Ingest Twitter Data into Snowflake","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-05-22T07:44:42-07:00"},{"duration":92,"title":"Automating Data Pipelines to Drive Marketing Analytics with Snowflake \u0026 Fivetran","categories":["Data Engineering","Partner Integrations","Marketing"],"contentType":"quickstart","url":"https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/vhol_fivetran/index.html","summary":"Automating Data Pipelines to Drive Marketing Analytics with Snowflake \u0026 Fivetran","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-12T11:16:58-07:00"},{"duration":56,"title":"Automating Document Processing Workflows With Document AI","categories":["Getting Started"],"contentType":"quickstart","url":"https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/automating_document_processing_workflows_with_document_ai/index.html","summary":"This guide will provide step-by-step details for automating document processing workflows with Document AI","lastUpdatedAt":"2024-09-12T11:16:57-07:00"},{"duration":85,"title":"AutoML with Snowflake and H2O Driverless AI","categories":["Data Science \u0026 ML","Partner Integrations"],"contentType":"quickstart","url":"https://quickstarts.snowflake.com/guide/automl_with_snowflake_and_h2o/index.html","summary":